---
title: A calendar that shuts up
date: 2026-06-09
readingTime: 6 min
dek: Designing a menu-bar dock that stays invisible until the next thing actually matters — a study in subtraction.
---

Most calendar apps want to be looked at. GRØD wants to be forgotten until the
moment it's useful, then say exactly one thing.

## Subtraction as a feature

Every element I removed made the next thing that mattered louder. No week grid.
No colour-coded chaos. Just the next event, the time until it, and a way to join
it — surfacing only when the countdown earns your attention.
